<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>We give ourselves to follow the followers,</l><l>By this we truly learn;</l><l>Never desiring to be the leaders,</l><l>But to the Spirit turn.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We give ourselves the flock’s steps to follow</l><l>Knowing the Shepherd’s care.</l><l>Now in the churches Jesus is leading</l><l>And He is speaking there.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>We give ourselves to Thee, O Lord Jesus,</l><l>Never to turn aside;</l><l>Where’er the Lamb goes, there we would follow,</l><l>Follow whate’er betide.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>We give ourselves to enter the kingdom,</l><l>That marriage feast, with Him;</l><l>Come persecution, suffering, and trials,</l><l>Still we will enter in.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>Christ wants some followers here in the churches,</l><l>Followers of whom to say:</l><l>“These saw My purpose, followed Me wholly”—</l><l>May we be those today!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
